contractual obligation only for loss typical and foreseeable when the contract
was made. Otherwise liability for slight negligence is excluded to the extent
permitted by law. Mandatory statutory rights, including consumer rights,
remain unaffected. No term excludes liability that cannot lawfully be excluded.

Public Source and voluntary contributions carry no separate promise of support,
acceptance, fitness or a particular outcome, subject to mandatory law and any
